+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project uses semantic versioning (semver), with version identifiers in MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH format tied to API compatibility: the major number increments for breaking changes, the minor number for backward-compatible feature additions, and the patch number for backward-compatible fixes.
